BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 679.0 Tm (ZFS integrates previously separate responsibilities to address silent data corruption,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 662.0 Tm (fragmentation across large arrays and complexity of volume management. The costs include) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 645.0 Tm (memory use for caching and metadata, COW write amplification, free-space pressure, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 628.0 Tm (dependence on vdev layout decisions that are not always reversible.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 599.0 Tm (A single ZFS.so shared library does not thereby become a complete pooled-storage engine.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 582.0 Tm (Pool import, device discovery, crash-consistent writing, resilvering, scrub, ARC) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 565.0 Tm (management, ZIL and vdev fault handling require much more than a parser that recognises an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.15 Tf 0.08 0.15 0.24 rg 1 0 0 1 50 548.0 Tm (uberblock.) Tj ET
